<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;[id://1177642|SSCCE] please... &lt;c&gt;\s&lt;/c&gt; works for me. Are you sure you're not using the &lt;c&gt;/a&lt;/c&gt; modifier or something like that?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
perl -wMstrict -lE "qq/\N{NARROW NO-BREAK SPACE}/ =~ /\A\s\z/ and say 'OK' or die"
OK
&lt;/c&gt;</doctext>
